"networking devices (*sys-net* by default), but rather to another net qube "
"first (*sys-firewall* by default). In most cases it would be the net qube "
"with networking devices that will crash, e.g. in response to S3 sleep/"
"restore or other issues with WiFi drivers. In that case it is only necessary "
"to issue the above command once, for the *sys-firewall* qube (following "
"named conventions used by the default Qubes installation):"
